+// `JSON` in a SWF 12 movie and `"::JSON"` in a SWF 9 movie are both #1065 --
+// avm2/json_version_gated), but an UNQUALIFIED runtime name is built with
+// `ApiVersion::VM_INTERNAL` (qname.rs:105), the version that sees
